{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Confirmation under the Master Agreement</h1>
<p>This confirmation records the terms of the transaction entered into between the fictional
parties named below. It forms part of, and is subject to, the Master Agreement assumed solely
for this research example. Defined terms have the meanings assigned in that agreement unless
expressly stated otherwise in this confirmation.</p>
<p>For each Calculation Period, the calculation agent shall determine the payment in accordance
with the applicable rate, Calculation Amount and Day Count Fraction. Each Calculation Period
begins on its first scheduled date and ends immediately before the next scheduled date.
Payment dates are subject to the Business Day Convention specified below.</p>
<p>These provisions illustrate contractual language only. No actual agreement, counterparty,
obligation or payment is created. The economic terms for each Calculation Period follow.</p>
{% for section in sections %}<h2>{{ section.title }}</h2>
{% for row in section.rows %}<p class="term">The {{ row.label }} shall be {{ value(row) }}.</p>{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}{% endblock %}
